          "text": "According to Mark C. Fleming (Petitioners), according to Mark C. Fleming (Petitioners), petitioners argued that \u00a71252(a)(2)(B)(i) does not bar review of the agency\u2019s threshold determination of ineligibility for adjustment of status."
